{"id": 147432822, "slug": "this-is-what-short-vol-feels-like", "title": "This is what short vol feels like", "subtitle": "Sell Low, Buy High", "post_date": "2024-08-08T02:03:09.768Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 1037, "reaction_count": 25, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 25}, "body_html": "<p>Market started falling again tonight, right into the close.  </p><p>This is what short vol feels like.</p><p>Every down move little more extended than reasonable.  </p><p>The rallies quick and vicious.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!T9vY!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7dccf00f-42ee-497c-b5e7-c3499084e4f6_925x624.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!T9vY!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7dccf00f-42ee-497c-b5e7-c3499084e4f6_925x624.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!T9vY!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7dccf00f-42ee-497c-b5e7-c3499084e4f6_925x624.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!T9vY!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7dccf00f-42ee-497c-b5e7-c3499084e4f6_925x624.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!T9vY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7dccf00f-42ee-497c-b5e7-c3499084e4f6_925x624.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!T9vY!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progres